1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,756
Run the installer.

2
00:00:04,756 --> 00:00:09,100
It installs for your user only, with no administrator rights.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,730
The portable zip and the Microsoft Store work too.

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:18,195
Enter your site's domain when asked, and choose whether to start with Windows,

5
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:20,945
play a ringtone, and keep the phone on top.

6
00:00:20,945 --> 00:00:23,920
Then sign in to the site inside the app window.

7
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:27,037
The app lives in the system tray.

8
00:00:27,037 --> 00:00:30,739
Right-click its icon for Open phone, Settings and Quit.

9
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:35,230
Closing the phone window keeps the app running, so calls still ring.

10
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:41,331
Incoming calls raise a Windows notification and a call window with the caller,

11
00:00:41,331 --> 00:00:45,917
the queue and matched records, with Answer, Decline and Voicemail.

12
00:00:45,917 --> 00:00:49,420
Settings has a General tab and a Diagnostics tab.

